  "reason": "The existing evidence shows config_024 (0.724989 accuracy) is the top performer with scvi_n200 RNA, imagenet_vit_l image, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion. This experiment tests pca_n2000 RNA and resnet50 image with transformer aggregation and concat fusion, which could clarify if changing RNA/image encoders while keeping transformer aggregation and switching fusion method impacts performance. It balances exploitation (using transformer aggregation from top models) and exploration (testing new encoders/fusion)."
